# Ink Drama Studio — per-episode working files.
#
# Everything an episode needs to be rebuilt IS committed: script, lines.json,
# voices.json, durs.json, envs.json, enc/*.mp3 (paid Cartesia audio),
# raw/*.png (the owner's ChatGPT images — hand work, not reproducible),
# crops.json / heads.json / mouths.json (mouth spots are hand-fixed),
# episode.js, build.py and any cut script copied into the episode.
#
# What is ignored below is either too big to keep or rebuilt by a script.

# raw Cartesia wav, ~5 MB a minute. enc/ is the kept copy, and tools/gen.py
# will not buy a line again while its enc/*.mp3 exists.
episodes/*/vo/
# regenerated from raw/ by the episode's cut scripts
episodes/*/crops/
# contact sheets, head/mouth overlays, screenshots — for looking at, not keeping
episodes/*/check/
# the built page and the art-pack zip — rebuilt by build.py / mkpack.py
episodes/*/out/
# base64 sprites, rebuilt by assets.py
episodes/*/assets*.js
